          <dt>Sources OK</dt><dd>Two TIER1 (Times of Israel/Reuters/AP) citing Knesset plenum vote record.</dd>
          <dt>Ambiguity</dt><dd>Preliminary/first/second readings without final passage do NOT count; if passage occurs but date is left to later committee: AMBIGUOUS-RESOLVE-AS-NO.</dd>
